    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 14 Stanford Green to the market, a charming family home set within one of Walkinstown’s most sought-after and established residential enclaves. Ideally positioned overlooking a mature green, this inviting property combines comfort, convenience and endless potential for its next owners. With a wealth of local amenities, excellent schools and superb transport links nearby, No. 14 offers an exceptional opportunity to put down roots in a thriving community. \r\nOn the ground floor you are welcomed by a generous entrance hall off which you will find the first reception room currently being utilised as a play room and home office. To the rear of the ground floor there is a sunny kitchen leading through to an open plan dining area with french doors leading to the sunny garden.  The dining area also connects to a cosy living room which provides an open plan space for entertaining or family life.\r\nOn the first floor you will find two generously sized bedrooms with the largest also benefiting from views across the green, there is also a smaller third bedroom which is ideal for a nursery or home office.  The first floor also houses a newly renovated family bathroom.\r\nCombining bright and well proportioned accommodation with a superb location 14 Stanford Green is a turnkey property providing a rare opportunity for families, first time buyers and investors alike to purchase in this much sought after location.  Early viewing is highly recommended to experience everything this charming property has to offer.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nProperty in Turnkey Condition\r\nLarge sunny garden\r\nPrime location overlooking the Green\r\nPrivate driveway"
      },
      {
